WEBVTT

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.190
This'll be my memory.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:30.120
So you like Makoto-kun, too?

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:35.210
That's why when I tried to go home with Makoto-kun the other day, you came between us.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.320
No, that was for Sekai.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.470
Then why did you kiss Makoto-kun, when Saionji-san loves him so much?!

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.610
You wouldn't normally kiss someone you don't like, right?

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:50.330
If Saionji-san knew about this...

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.790
Stop!

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.510
I'm going to be leaving soon.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:59.110
I wanted memories that were just my own...

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:00.810
That's all.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:06.440
Th-That doesn't really have anything to do with me or Makoto-kun.

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:09.040
Oh, Katsura.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.820
Excuse me.

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.550
Did something happen with Katsura?

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:16.690
No.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.600
Sakakino Academy Fair

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.600
Principal's Office

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:55.810
After being called to the principal's office and getting yelled at yesterday,

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:59.260
we entered into a non-aggression pact with classes 1 and 2.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.800
So, please hold down the fort.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.130
Setsuna, where are you going?

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:07.100
I leave the rest to all of you.

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.030
From that angle, it looks like there's a pall hanging over her.

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:13.710
Yeah, maybe the class pres is all burnt out from yesterday.

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:16.760
That's because all of you destroyed the classroom!

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.900
Sorry about that.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:22.390
I guess that means we won't have another customer-getting circus.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:26.500
Setsuna worked hard yesterday, so we should let her rest.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.220
Let's handle the customers today on our own.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:37.230
You laid your hands on the flower that everyone desires.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:41.330
No, I merely touched it once.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:46.500
It was only for the purpose of leaving sweet memories locked away in my heart.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:50.740
I had not the slightest intention to set loose...

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:54.970
...pain in this world by putting my feelings for that flower to words.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:04:00.220
So are you saying that if there was no one to hear those words, you could get away with anything?

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:04.660
That if so, there would be no difference in what has occurred?

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:12.020
I... I...

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:14.970
I...

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:28.470
What a pain... Kiyoura's off somewhere anyway, why don't we just call it quits for today?

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.550
Don't say that.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:34.210
We've been in the kitchen this whole time. Aren't you bored already?

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:41.530
I'm having a lot of fun making cakes with you like this.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.890
I guess if you're going to say that...

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.510
Hey, try this.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.790
Say "ahhh."

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.020
Ahhh.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:55.060
Makoto, you've got some cream on your nose.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:56.520
Oh, I guess it flew up there.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:58.870
Don't move for a second.

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:02.890
It's sweet.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.210
G-Get a room.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:10.320
Makoto's lucky to have a girlfriend.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.870
Where do you want to go next?

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:17.930
Katsura!

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.830
Katsura!

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.610
Are you even tending to the customers?

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:27.500
You're acting pretty depressing. You'd better shape up since you're helping run the fair.

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.280
You're right. I'm sorry.

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:32.590
So are you helping people to the <i>other</i> spot, too?

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:33.840
Other spot?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.920
The Break Room.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.160
Yes.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.200
You should get it together.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:46.490
The haunted house and the Break Room are one of Sakakino Academy's three traditions!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.100
The first is to go around the fair as a couple.

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.710
The second is the folk dance on the last day.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:56.070
And the best one is this Break Room!

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:59.850
A girl will go up to the boy she likes and hold out her hand.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:02.610
That's how he knows she's asking him out.

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:05.270
Will you?

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:11.370
If the boy wants to go out with the girl, he'll grab her hand.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:21.120
And then hand-in-hand, the two of them will disappear into the Break Room.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.150
Oh my!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:26.060
This is one of our school's precious traditions.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.200
Yeah...

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:29.200
Do you really understand?

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:30.870
Yes...

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:40.320
Geez, all of these guys... This sucks.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:43.080
It's lonely being single.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.920
Whoa there.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:53.810
Yo!

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.060
Sawanaga-san.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.090
Were you in the middle of something?

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:58.500
Who were you texting?

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:01.050
That's none of your business.

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.960
I guess not.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.190
Hey, Katsura-san, haven't you been at the front desk since yesterday?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:11.840
Everyone seems pretty busy, so I can't really get away.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.430
You're doing way too much on your own.

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:18.360
Why don't you just tell someone to switch with you and push it onto them?

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:20.630
I can't do that!

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:24.070
I'm the class president and the fair planner.

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:26.350
Oh, welcome.

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:33.420
Um, Sawanaga-san, if you stand there, the customers will have trouble coming in.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.730
Sorry.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:40.970
Um...

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:42.220
Hey!

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:43.050
Yes?

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:45.540
Want to go around the fair with me today?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:50.220
I haven't really made any plans to go with anyone, so I'm by myself.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.590
So, I was thinking that maybe we'd go to the folk dance together, too.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:56.300
I'm sorry.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:08:00.860
I said this before, but I'm Makoto-kun's girlfriend.

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:06.010
Wha-? But it really looks like Makoto's dating Saionji...

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:08.450
Is that what Makoto-kun is saying?!

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:11.240
N-No, but that's just what it looks like...

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:15.990
I'm Makoto-kun's girlfriend!
I'll ask you not to get that wrong!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:19.200
Oh, you're right. I'm sorry.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.570
Why did I even say that?

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:21.690
I was wrong.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:28.620
I'm sorry. That's how it is, so I can't go around the fair with you.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:31.750
N-No, don't worry about it.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:32.620
I'm sorry.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.690
Sorry.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.860
Makoto-kun.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.470
Makoto-kun!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:48.630
Jeez, stop that.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:49.870
Stop that already.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:52.310
Someone's gonna see us.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:54.100
So you're okay if someone doesn't see?

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.070
Dummy.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:57.490
How about we take a break?

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:58.890
What are you saying?!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:01.090
Okay, let's get back to work.

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:02.690
I told you to stop!

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.930
We've got a lot more cake to make.

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:11.520
If you're just going to get in the way, go somewhere else, idiot.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.690
Katsura just kind of pisses you off.

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:17.800
It's like she's stuck-up.

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:23.310
Yeah, it's like "I'm different from all of you."

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:24.990
Yeah, like that!

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:30.560
Wait, you couldn't have!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:34.110
Sorry, my boyfriend's here...

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:35.480
I'll be going.

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:38.320
Let us see him, too!

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:39.940
It's too embarrassing!

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:41.570
You traitor!

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:45.300
You don't have time anyway, right?

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:45.850
Huh?

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.690
You're going to ask Itou in Class 3 out right?

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:48.790
Right...

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.540
You need to be a traitor, too!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.040
This is the chance you've been waiting for!

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:57.840
Itou!

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:02.270
Do you have some free time?

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.540
I was forced to.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.660
Th-That's good.

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:14.360
Th-Then if you haven't really picked anyone to go around the fair with, do you want to go with me?

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.470
With you?

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:18.090
What's up all of a sudden?

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:19.500
Never mind.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:21.150
It's okay if you don't want to.

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:22.480
If you don't want to, that is.

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:24.500
Sure, why not?

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:26.630
Are you sure?!

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.430
Yeah.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.840
We haven't been together like this since middle school.

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.180
Yeah, I guess so.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:38.260
We used to mess around all the time back then.

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:39.180
Yeah, we did.

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:43.430
Once we got into high school, we ended up in different classes

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.200
Viewing Fee
300 Yen

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:47.820
and haven't really had the chance to see each other or hang out.

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:49.440
Yeah.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:51.850
That fortune...

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.540
It said we'd be pretty good together.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:11:02.590
That's pretty good. All we did was fight back in middle school.

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:04.610
You know, Itou...

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:09.750
Do you think we could dance together in the folk dance?

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:10.620
Huh?

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:16.400
Isn't that like for couple who just started dating to showcase themselves.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.590
You should ask the person you like.

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:21.090
That's why I'm asking you.

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:32.750
Katou's pretty hot too when you look at her.

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:37.350
Makoto!

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:40.310
Don't actually slack off!

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:42.970
We don't have enough people so come back!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.060
You've already goofed off enough, right?

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:51.650
Itou...

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:59.360
I got it! I got it, so let go!

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:01.610
What? Are you getting jealous?

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:05.380
She's just a friend from middle school. It's not like that!

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:09.990
Hey, the two who need to get a room, there you are.

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:11.010
No, we don't!

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:14.380
Hey, Itou-san, your girlfriend just came to the classroom.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.530
What?!

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:30.090
It's Makoto-kun!

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:31.490
Kokoro-chan.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:36.400
My sister told me that you'd be here.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.470
Itou sure is popular.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.910
Jeez, what did you mean girlfriend?

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:42.930
This is my friend, Uzuki-chan.

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:43.970
Hello.

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:47.390
Hi there.

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:51.510
This is Kotonoha's little sister and her friend, Uzuki-chan.

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.480
Oh, hi.

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:59.090
My sister said she's been looking forward to dancing with Makoto-kun in the folk dance!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:05.340
Wouldn't she be Makoto-kun's girlfriend?

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:10.840
No, Uzuki-chan. Makoto-kun's girlfriend is my sister.

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.160
Looks pretty complicated.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.900
They're all grown up.

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.650
What do you mean?

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.480
You don't have a girlfriend, so you wouldn't know.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.840
Huh?!

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:25.390
Saying things like that isn't fair, Uzuki-chan!

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:29.650
Kokoro-chan, Uzuki-chan, we have some tasty cake. Want some?

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:33.470
Oh, we're out of time. We'll have to get going.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:35.090
Really?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.190
Let's go get some cake.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:40.500
It's already time to meet my tutor.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.860
Oh, really?

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:43.180
Tutor?

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:46.170
Yeah, he's pretty cool.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:47.910
See you later, Makoto-kun.

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.010
Bye-bye!

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:59.650
Oh, Katsura. How's the front desk doing?

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:03.070
I'm sorry. The School Fair Planning Board asked for me...

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:04.590
I'll be back soon.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:08.260
Hey, Katsura, you have a boyfriend, right?

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:09.530
Yeah...

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:13.130
So how about you take some time in the Break Room for yourself, too?

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:18.200
That's mean, Natsumi. You've heard, right?

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.240
Katsura's broken up with her boyfriend.

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:22.040
No, we haven't!

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:25.640
Has your boyfriend come to see you today?

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.150
No...

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:32.820
If he's your boyfriend, he'd come to see you, right?

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:35.300
Makoto-kun is busy.

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.890
She said he was busy.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:44.560
Of course he is. He's probably going around the fair with another girl.

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:46.900
I don't think you need the probably.

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:53.640
That couldn't happen...because I'm going out with him.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:56.940
Hey, Katsura, you don't look too happy.

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:59.210
Why don't you just admit it already?

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:02.150
That you're not going out with Makoto at all.

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:03.310
I am!

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:07.990
You might have gone out with him,
but you've already broken up, right?!

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.720
No, we haven't!

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:14.600
Oh, really? Then bring him here!

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.690
Yeah.

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:18.160
If you're dating, then that shouldn't be a problem, should it?

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:21.160
Makoto-kun will come!

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:37.500
My sister said she's been looking forward to dancing with Makoto-kun in the folk dance!

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:40.180
Makoto.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:45.520
You're going to dance in the folk dance with me, right?

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:49.460
Is it really that important?

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:50.780
It is!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:56.210
It's the same thing as announcing to everyone that we're actually dating.

00:15:56.210 --> 00:15:58.250
Well, that's true...

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:02.040
So you'll dance with, right, Makoto?

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.990
Y-Yeah.

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:06.300
You promise, right?

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:13.120
I couldn't get him to promise to dance with me at the folk dance.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:21.090
Y-You're the guy who's always with Itou...

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:27.460
What are you doing in this desolate place?

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.730
It's the school fair.

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:33.090
No matter where I go, it's full of couples.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.240
There's no place for me.

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:37.050
So you're not popular.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.300
You're in the same boat, right?

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:40.940
You're here all depressed.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:45.080
Hey, don't actually get depressed.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:48.720
Hey, about Itou...

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:52.340
Is he actually dating Katsura?

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:54.890
Well, about that...

00:16:54.890 --> 00:17:01.520
I heard he broke up with her,
but he always avoids the issue.

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:05.310
Isn't that the exact same as he's not dating her?

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:06.560
Who knows?

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:10.650
It just looks to me like he's dating Saionji.

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:17.920
Ever since second semester started, it's almost like I don't know what he's thinking at all.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:21.420
I feel bad for Katsura-san, too.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.300
She's really cute.

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:26.630
What?! You like Katsura, too?!

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:28.630
Uh, well...

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:31.860
Say it! You're not being manly at all!

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:36.410
But, Katsura-san says she's dating Makoto.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.710
What are you going to do, giving up after hearing that?!

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:41.880
And you call yourself a man?

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.370
But...

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:47.200
With girls, even if you're turn down the first or second time, you have to keep pushing them!

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.650
Really?!

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:51.690
If that doesn't work, then she really hates you.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:54.480
I guess so...

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:57.180
I'm getting pissed just looking at you.

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:04.670
I should stop moping around here, and just go and say it.

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:05.830
Say what?

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:09.830
I'm going to make my feelings heard once and for all!

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:13.320
Hey, where are you going?!

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.810
You do your best, too!

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:21.340
Hey, don't cling to me so much.

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:23.330
It's fine, right?

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:26.470
Don't you have to go take care of the customers?

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:28.350
Kuroda and the others are having a hard time by themselves, right?

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:30.220
Sekai, help me out!

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:32.230
S-Sure!

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:43.750
Email
20 Items
Katsura Kotonoha

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:49.840
Itou!

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:52.570
Katou...

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.010
Huh, what?

00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.200
A punch?

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.470
No!

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:01.720
Give me your hand.

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:02.650
Huh?

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:03.600
Jeez!

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.940
Wh-What's with you all of a sudden?!

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.600
Please come with me...

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:20.840
What is this place?

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:25.560
This is...the Sakakino Academy Break Room, a tradition here among all the girls.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:26.540
Huh?

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:28.190
You haven't heard of it?

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.780
You come here with the person you like.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:33.280
This is-!

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:35.030
You know, Itou...

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:47.300
You may not have seen me as a girl,
but I've liked you since middle school.

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:52.900
Do you not want to become more than friends with me?

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:55.090
No, I...

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:55.910
Do you not want to?

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:58.410
That's not it, but...

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:02.980
Your boyfriend didn't show, did he?

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:05.880
The folk dance is going to start soon.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:19.140
Are you sure you weren't just mistaken, and he wasn't your boyfriend at all?

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:21.200
Oh, that's terrible!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.200
Makoto-kun is dating me...

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:29.400
Makoto-kun is just really busy with something important.

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:31.530
I'm sure... I'm sure he is.

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:35.640
You know, Itou's...

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:36.780
Natsumi!

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:43.280
Let's go.

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.670
Y-Yeah...

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:55.770
I'm stuck...

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:57.910
You mean the folk dance?

00:20:57.910 --> 00:20:58.770
Yeah.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:06.010
I got it! You'd better go so we're not found.

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:07.110
Sorry.

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:20.420
Makoto-kun.

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:22.210
Katsura-san.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:23.650
Sawanaga-san.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:26.060
Um, where's Makoto-kun?

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:28.800
Makoto's not here anymore.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.410
What are you saying?

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.740
We're dating, you know.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:37.900
Makoto went to the folk dance with Saionji.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:39.380
Why?

00:21:39.380 --> 00:21:42.040
I'm the one dating him.

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:44.350
Makoto doesn't think so anymore.

00:21:44.350 --> 00:21:45.590
That's a lie!

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:46.570
No, it's not!

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:50.640
Why... Why do you keep lying like that?

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:53.090
I'm not lying... He...

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:55.480
Makoto betrayed you!

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:58.040
I-I...

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:01.610
I love you, Katsura-san.

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:03.300
I love you!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:13.710
I love you.

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:16.310
I love you, Katsura-san!

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:19.420
Makoto-kun...

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:33.360
I had not the slightest intention to set loose...

00:22:33.980 --> 00:22:37.800
...pain in this world by putting my feelings for that flower to words.

00:22:38.570 --> 00:22:43.770
So are you saying that if there was no one to hear those words, you could get away with anything?

00:22:45.200 --> 00:22:48.080
I'm your girlfriend, right?

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:03.940
Makoto-kun...

00:24:45.900 --> 00:24:53.040
Next time
Mind and Body
